      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارتفد</span></b>  <i>He gained, acquired,</i> or <i>earned,</i> (T, S,
M, A, K,) property. (T, M, A.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارتفدتُ مِنْهُ</span>
<i>I obtained a gift,</i> or <i>aid, from him.</i> (A.)

